        "text": "Step 3: A $90^\\circ$ clockwise rotation corresponds to multiplying by $e^{-i\\pi/2} = -i$. So, we multiply $7 + 5i$ by $-i$ to apply the rotation. This gives $(7 + 5i)(-i) = -7i - 5i^2$."
